No vendor hardware database is bundled.

udev-standalone reads plain-text *.hwdb files from /etc/udev/hwdb.d and
/lib/udev/hwdb.d (or UDEV_HWDB_PATH when testing). Local entries can be dropped
there; the parser uses simple glob matching and does not need a binary hwdb.bin.

A small demo database lives in examples/hwdb.d/.
